 J. Make training inputs reproducible — T1                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 MAX_GAP_S=1800 is not a meaningful quality gate for a 128-second training window. Within-window gaps shorter than that can be filled by long zero-order holds.                             
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 Required loader contract:                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 - Validate timestamp order and units.                                                                                                                                                      
 - Define duplicate resolution.                                                                                                                                                             
 - Reject non-finite measurements rather than turning them into artificial OFF events.                                                                                                      
 - Check sample age/coverage against the source’s expected 3–6 second cadence.                                                                                                              
 - Include the preceding held sample when testing gap coverage.                                                                                                                             
 - Preserve quality/provenance per window.                                                                                                                                                  
 - Keep repaired/low-coverage windows out of validation.                                                                                                                                    
 - Fingerprint source files, canonical mapping, thresholds, sequence length and extraction version in cache metadata.                                                                       
 - Write caches through temporary-file/atomic-replace with a lock.                                                                                                                          
 - Store provenance as non-object strings so cached data can load without pickle.                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 Maintain house/device/session-separated validation. A single projector instance cannot establish unseen-projector generalization.                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                            
