 4. Production Readiness Checklist                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 These are sequential release gates. Any failed P0 gate blocks mains deployment.                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 Gate 1 — Freeze a reproducible release                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 - [ ] Record commit, existing changes, firmware hash, dependency versions and model hashes.                                                                                                
 - [ ] Select one physical profile explicitly.                                                                                                                                              
 - [ ] Resolve projector scope versus the existing 250 W hardware rating.                                                                                                                   
 - [ ] Align firmware constants, twin and backend profile without casually changing protection thresholds.                                                                                  
 - [ ] Remove obsolete wiring/run instructions.                                                                                                                                             
 - [ ] Verify deployment image contains no local secrets or runtime database.                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 Gate 2 — Electrical design approval                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 Performed by qualified personnel, not inferred from software:                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 - [ ] Verify actual meter isolation and UART voltage compatibility.                                                                                                                        
 - [ ] Verify relay input topology, boot pull-down and contact load category.                                                                                                               
 - [ ] Verify protective earth continuity, polarity, terminals, strain relief, enclosure and applicable insulation requirements.                                                            
 - [ ] Verify independent overcurrent/residual-current protection.                                                                                                                          
 - [ ] Establish what “relay open confirmed” means and test the feedback path if claimed.                                                                                                   
 - [ ] No exposed bench jumpers in the commercial assembly.                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 Gate 3 — Firmware safety fault injection                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 Run against the compiled firmware path, then physical hardware:                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 - [ ] PZEM absent from boot: every production ON is rejected.                                                                                                                              
 - [ ] PZEM lost after healthy operation: measured cutoff deadline is met.                                                                                                                  
 - [ ] CRC errors, truncated frames, stuck finite values and implausible registers.                                                                                                         
 - [ ] ON arriving before/during/after every safety trip: no re-energization race.                                                                                                          
 - [ ] Reboot/brownout during lockout and during relay actuation.                                                                                                                           
 - [ ] Safety-task creation failure and forced task hang.                                                                                                                                   
 - [ ] millis() rollover around the PZEM cache and lockout timers.                                                                                                                          
 - [ ] Wi-Fi/broker completely absent while local protection remains effective.                                                                                                             
 - [ ] Retained, duplicated, expired and wrong-boot ON requests rejected.                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 Gate 4 — Power and EMI bench qualification                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 - [ ] Scope 5 V/3.3 V during Wi-Fi transmission and relay switching.                                                                                                                       
 - [ ] Controlled mains sag/interruption/recovery testing with appropriate equipment.                                                                                                       
 - [ ] Measure actual PZEM transaction/refresh latency and worst-case fault response.                                                                                                       
 - [ ] Record UART errors during switching and representative load inrush.                                                                                                                  
 - [ ] Thermal soak at the approved continuous envelope.                                                                                                                                    
 - [ ] Instrumented calibration across the relevant low-power range and approved maximum.                                                                                                   
 - [ ] Unavailable equipment means NOT RUN, not “passed by simulation.”                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 Gate 5 — Real broker/API integration                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 - [ ] Start real Mosquitto with the deployment ACL/TLS configuration.                                                                                                                      
 - [ ] Verify each device can access only its own topics.                                                                                                                                   
 - [ ] Verify API receives UI/status/ACK events and cannot issue relay commands.                                                                                                            
 - [ ] Verify unauthorized HTTP/WS access is rejected.                                                                                                                                      
 - [ ] Inject malformed UTF-8/JSON/schema/NaN frames; bridge stays alive.                                                                                                                   
 - [ ] Kill the pipeline while broker/API stay alive; readiness and UI become degraded.                                                                                                     
 - [ ] Rotate/revoke a device credential successfully.                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 Gate 6 — Telemetry and persistence recovery                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                            
 - [ ] Outages of 1 second, 30 seconds and the declared spool-retention duration.                                                                                                           
 - [ ] Duplicate/out-of-order/delayed samples preserve temporal correctness.                                                                                                                
 - [ ] Missing intervals remain visible.                                                                                                                                                    
